\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Resource trajectories for static rule agents (representative episode with full 300-sol survival). The first storm (sol~60--120, orange shading) drives progressive battery decline; Storm~2 (sol~200--235, red shading) shows a second dip in available power. Temperature declines gradually through both storms toward the lower survivable bound. Both trajectory curves are visible across the full 0--250~sol time axis.}}{9}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:traj}{{1}{9}{Resource trajectories for static rule agents (representative episode with full 300-sol survival). The first storm (sol~60--120, orange shading) drives progressive battery decline; Storm~2 (sol~200--235, red shading) shows a second dip in available power. Temperature declines gradually through both storms toward the lower survivable bound. Both trajectory curves are visible across the full 0--250~sol time axis}{figure.caption.4}{}}
