\newlabel{fig:actions}{{3}{11}{Agent power allocations during a representative episode with full 300-sol survival. Top: the Science Agent (purple) shuts down experiments during both storms (orange and red shaded regions). The Thermal Agent (red) maintains heating with modest reductions during storms, exploiting the lava tube's thermal inertia. The Power Agent (blue) holds life support near nominal levels. Middle: evolution of the Survival Stability Index $S(t)$. Bottom: battery state-of-charge across the full episode}{figure.caption.7}{}}
